{"id":"574628398","kind":"article","title":"重复历史","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Repetition_history"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2022-10-18","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":2,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":655,"keywords":["重复历史","间隔重复","提取性","最优间隔","记忆稳定性","SuperMemo"],"summary":"本文定义“重复历史”为记录间隔复习日期与评分的数据序列，并说明 SuperMemo 还记录复习时刻等信息。配图以提取性、最优间隔和稳定性呈现一个知识片段的记忆变化；作者据一段实际复习记录指出，早期稳定性低时提取性下降较快，后续复习后则更缓慢。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/574628398","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"Qqc148pn\"><b>重复历史</b>是对在<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔复习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>过程中的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">重复</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>的记录。每个重复历史中最少包括：（1）重复日期（2）复习的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Grade\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">评分</a>。而 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup> 则会额外记录一些数据（例如用于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SleepChart\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">睡眠研究</a>的重复的确切时间）</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-2a62b38d8572f8877242e2d9e49d63df\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2a62b38d8572f8877242e2d9e49d63df_r.jpg\" width=\"500\"/><figcaption>SuperMemo: Changes in two variables of long-term memory</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"uuuX1Ijw\"> 图：示例<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Piece_of_knowledge\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">知识片段</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>的记忆状态随时间的变化。横轴表示跨越整个重复历史的时间。顶部面板展示了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Retrievability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可提取性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>（为了便于分析，进行十次方变换，R^10）。灰色的可提取性网格标记了 R=99%, R=98% 等标签。中部面板用深蓝色展示了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Optimum_interval\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最优间隔</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>。复习日期由蓝色垂线和浅蓝色标签标记。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Optimum_interval\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最优间隔</a>的末端对应的 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Retrievability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">R</a> 为 90% 左右，由红色垂线标记（仅当实际复习<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Interval\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔</a>大等于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Optimum_interval\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">最优间隔</a>时）。底部面板可视化了<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Stability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">稳定性</a>（为了便于分析，以 <code>ln(S)/ln(days)</code> 的形式展示）。该图表指出 ，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Retrievability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可提取性</a>在最初几次<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Stability\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">稳定性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>很低时的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">复习</a>中下降得很快（指数型）。然而在第 7 次复习后，经过十年时间，可提取性从 100% 只下降到了 94%。所有的数值都来自实际的复习历史和<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Three_component_model_of_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆的三变量模型</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"mc-eAOWm\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 Kureist<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Repetition_history\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Repetition history - supermemo.guru</a><br/>本<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Glossary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">术语表</a>条目用于解释 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/SuperMemo_Guru\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SuperMemo</a>，一位自 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/History_of_spaced_repetition_(print)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">1987</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup> 年以来的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复</a>软件先驱。</blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔重复（spaced repetition） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"305651556\" href=\"#/post/305651556\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 重复 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"572444486\" href=\"#/post/572444486\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 什么是 SuperMemo <a href=\"https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/supermemo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/supermemo</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 条目 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"571700330\" href=\"#/post/571700330\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 记忆可提取性 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"559819340\" href=\"#/post/559819340\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 最优间隔 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"584041631\" href=\"#/post/584041631\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 记忆稳定性 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"559298549\" href=\"#/post/559298549\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 记忆的三组分模型 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"580945538\" href=\"#/post/580945538\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-9\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-9\">↩</a> 《间隔重复的历史》 <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/375379522\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/375379522</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"572809684","title":"卡片分享","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"578902325","title":"卡片写作的模拟教学法","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"584041631","title":"最优间隔","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":8,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"571700330","title":"条目","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"559819340","title":"记忆可提取性","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":8,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"279166945","title":"间隔效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「间隔重复」· Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"1941069300833190267","title":"感知内容的间隔重复","author":"Giacomo Randazzo","votes":62,"minutes":21,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「间隔重复」· Giacomo Randazzo"},{"id":"1907760881749718522","title":"间隔重复记忆系统：已取得长足进步","author":"Domenic Denicola","votes":261,"minutes":12,"reason":"